OL,3,GNEWSAPolice name man, 21, killed in
OL,4,Acrash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 21-year-old man who died following a
OL,7,Fcrash on Friday has been named as Josh
OL,8,FMcKnight from the Loughbrickland area.
OL,10,FOne vehicle was involved in the
OL,11,Fcollision which happened on the Old
OL,12,FMill Road near Banbridge at about 05:50
OL,13,FBST.
OL,15,FEmergency services attended but he was
OL,16,Fpronounced dead at the scene.
OL,18,FPolice have asked anyone who witnessed
OL,19,Fthe crash or has dash cam footage to
OL,20,Fget in touch.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
